                <div class="bundle-matrix-row"><span>IG Reel + Newsletter</span><strong>$3,200</strong></div>
                <div class="bundle-matrix-row"><span>LinkedIn + IG Carousel + Newsletter</span><strong>$4,200</strong></div>
                <div class="bundle-matrix-row"><span>LinkedIn + IG Reel + Newsletter</span><strong>$4,600</strong></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swiper-slide" data-theme="cream">
        <div class="luxury-watermark" data-swiper-parallax="-400">06</div>
        <div class="slide-inner split-layout inversion-layout screen-constrained" data-swiper-parallax="-200">
          <div class="slide-visual-panel image-constrained-wrapper">
            <div class="image-mask editorial-clip">
            <img src={slide7Image.src} class="slide-image" alt="Misa Chien Media Terms">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="slide-content">
            <h2 class="section-heading">ON-SITE / MEDIA TERMS</h2>
            <p class="intro-context-text">Remote podcast and media invitations are considered on a case-by-case basis depending on format and fit.</p>
            
            <h3 class="subsection-subheading">Starting Point</h3>
            <ul class="pricing-anchors-rates-list fine-line-list">
              <li><span>On-site podcast or media appearances</span> <strong class="price-anchor-tag">from $1,800</strong></li>
              <li><span>Travel and parking logistics</span> <strong class="price-anchor-tag">Reimbursed</strong></li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="subsection-subheading small-margin-top">Please Note</h3>
            <ul class="additional-notes-bullet-points long-list-optimized">
              <li>Sponsored appearances are treated as paid partnerships</li>
              <li>TV, broadcast, and travel requirements are scoped dynamically</li>
              <li>Paid usage, whitelisting, and pinning entail distinct production briefs</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swiper-slide" data-theme="light">
        <div class="luxury-watermark" data-swiper-parallax="-400">07</div>
        <div class="slide-inner basic-centered-layout screen-constrained" data-swiper-parallax="-200">
          <div class="centered-content-container-block editorial-box">
            <h2 class="section-heading text-center">PRODUCT GIFTING</h2>
            <p class="gifting-subtitle-subtext text-center">(No Guaranteed Deliverables)</p>
            <p class="intro-context-text text-center max-width-optimized-center">We welcome gifted products based strictly on organic brand fit and community relevance.</p>
            
            <div class="gifting-notes-box-layout">
              <ul class="additional-notes-bullet-points inline-centered-list-bullets">
                <li>Gifting does not guarantee social features or content execution</li>
                <li>Guaranteed coverage mandates standard integration/campaign structures</li>
                <li>Timelines are evaluated post-receipt. TikTok is not an active distribution channel</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swiper-slide" data-theme="cream">
        <div class="luxury-watermark" data-swiper-parallax="-400">08</div>
        <div class="slide-inner split-layout screen-constrained" data-swiper-parallax="-200">
          <div class="slide-content">
            <h2 class="section-heading">USAGE RIGHTS</h2>
            <div class="main-term-callout-banner">
              <p>USAGE IS QUOTED SEPARATELY BASED ON SCOPE, CHANNEL, DURATION, AND TERRITORY.</p>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="subsection-subheading">Standard Usage Terms:</h3>
            <ul class="additional-notes-bullet-points fine-line-list compressed-line-height">
              <li>ORGANIC REPOSTING ON BRAND CHANNELS</li>
              <li>WEBSITE AND EMAIL MARKETING INTEGERS</li>
              <li>PAID ADS & AUTHORIZED WHITELISTING</li>
              <li>PROMOTIONAL CUT-DOWNS & EDITS</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="subsection-subheading small-margin-top">ADDITIONAL FEES & LIMITATIONS:</h3>
            <p class="block-body-text micro-caps-paragraph">EXCLUSIVITY • RUSH TIMELINES • ADDED CONTENT ROUNDS • MODERATION ASSIGNMENTS • HMU EXPENSES • AUTHENTICITY MATTERS (NO RIGID/SCRIPTED DICTATIONS)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="slide-visual-panel image-constrained-wrapper">
            <div class="image-mask editorial-clip">
            <img src={slide9Image.src} class="slide-image" alt="Misa Chien Usage Rights">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swiper-slide" data-theme="cream">
        <div class="luxury-watermark" data-swiper-parallax="-400">09</div>
        <div class="slide-inner split-layout inversion-layout screen-constrained" data-swiper-parallax="-200">
          <div class="slide-visual-panel image-constrained-wrapper">
            <div class="image-mask editorial-clip">
            <img src={slide10Image.src} class="slide-image" alt="Misa Chien Contact">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="slide-content">
            <h2 class="section-heading">REQUEST A QUOTE</h2>
            <p class="intro-context-text">Provide collaboration type, platforms, location data, usage timelines, and your target budget scale.</p>
            
            <div class="contact-card-anchor-block">
              <span class="contact-pre-header-label">PARTNERSHIP MANAGEMENT:</span>
              <p class="agent-contact-name-text">BERNADINE COTE</p>
              <a href="mailto:BERNADINE@THEAUTHENTICASIAN.COM" class="btn-filled-luxury">
                <span>BERNADINE@THEAUTHENTICASIAN.COM</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
    
    <div class="swiper-scrollbar"></div>
    <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
    <div class="swiper-button-prev"></div>
    <div class="swiper-button-next"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  import 'swiper/css';
  import 'swiper/css/navigation';
  import 'swiper/css/pagination';
  import 'swiper/css/scrollbar';
  
  import Swiper from 'swiper';
  import { Navigation, Pagination, Scrollbar, Keyboard, Mousewheel, Parallax } from 'swiper/modules';

  const initSwiper = () => {
    const swiperEl = document.querySelector('.mediaKitSwiper');
    if (swiperEl && !swiperEl.swiper) {
      new Swiper('.mediaKitSwiper', {
        modules: [Navigation, Pagination, Scrollbar, Keyboard, Mousewheel, Parallax],
        direction: 'horizontal',
        loop: false,
        speed: 1000,
        parallax: true,
        mousewheel: { forceToAxis: true, sensitivity: 0.8 },
        keyboard: { enabled: true, onlyInViewport: true },
        scrollbar: { el: '.swiper-scrollbar', draggable: true },
        pagination: {
          el: '.swiper-pagination',
          clickable: true,
          type: 'fraction',
          renderFraction: function (currentClass, totalClass) {
            return `<span class="${currentClass}"></span><span class="separator">/</span><span class="${totalClass}"></span>`;
          }
        },
        navigation: { nextEl: '.swiper-button-next', prevEl: '.swiper-button-prev' },
        on: {
          init: function (swiper) {
            const initialSlide = swiper.slides[swiper.activeIndex];
            swiper.el.setAttribute('data-current-theme', initialSlide.getAttribute('data-theme') || 'light');
          },
          slideChange: function (swiper) {
            const activeSlide = swiper.slides[swiper.activeIndex];
            swiper.el.setAttribute('data-current-theme', activeSlide.getAttribute('data-theme') || 'light');
          }
        }
      });
    }
  };

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initSwiper);
  setTimeout(initSwiper, 100);
</script>

<style>
  .media-kit-swiper-wrapper {
    --burgundy: #59363a;
    --coral: #e77860;
    --cream-background: #fef4ef;
    --soft-white: #ffffff;
    --light-grey-border: rgba(89, 54, 58, 0.12);
    --dark-grey-text: #333333;
    --font-display: 'Tenor Sans', sans-serif;
    --font-sans: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--soft-white);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .luxury-noise-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 50;
    opacity: 0.035;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.75' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  }

  .swiper {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100vh;
    max-height: 100vh;
  }

  .swiper-slide {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 4vh 6vw;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .swiper-slide[data-theme="cream"] { background-color: var(--cream-background); }
  .swiper-slide[data-theme="light"] { background-color: var(--soft-white); }
  .swiper-slide[data-theme="dark"] { background-color: var(--burgundy); }


  .screen-constrained {
    height: 82vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .image-constrained-wrapper {
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 70vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .image-mask {
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }

  .slide-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .luxury-watermark {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28vh;
    color: var(--coral);
    opacity: 0.04;
    line-height: 1;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    bottom: 8vh;
    right: 4vw;
  }
  .luxury-watermark.light-watermark { color: var(--soft-white); opacity: 0.025; }

  .meta-category-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--burgundy);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--coral);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 3vh;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: calc(2.8rem + 2vw);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--burgundy);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: 1vh;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--coral);
    margin-bottom: 3vh;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: calc(1.5rem + 0.8vw);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--burgundy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 3vh;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .section-heading.inverse-text { color: var(--soft-white); }

  .subsection-subheading {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--coral);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 2vh;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .small-margin-top { margin-top: 2.5vh; }

  .header-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--burgundy);
    margin-bottom: 3vh;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--coral);
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
  }

  .slide-description, .intro-context-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--dark-grey-text);
    margin-bottom: 3vh;
    max-width: 440px;
  }

 
  .split-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 5vw;
  }

  .grid-two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4vw;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .editorial-border-right {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--light-grey-border);
    padding-right: 3vw;
  }

  .metrics-display-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .metric-group h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--coral);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .metric-group p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  
  .value-prop-list li, .additional-notes-bullet-points li {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.2vh;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .value-prop-list li::before, .additional-notes-bullet-points li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--coral);
  }

  .compact-inline-notes {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .compact-inline-notes li { padding-left: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.8rem;}

  .fine-line-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.85vh 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light-grey-border);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .fine-line-list li::before { display: none; }

  .options-interactive-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5vh 2vw;
  }

  .luxury-border-bottom {
